// Source hash: md5:c48dcb066c11734cfcff7d0060b289d8
// Status: generalization_required (bridges: empty_case:A, hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem CLOSURE_OF_RESTRICT : forall A:set, forall top :e topology A, forall s c= A, closure_of A top s = closure_of A top (topspace A top :/\: s).
Admitted.

