// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_finite_finite, hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem CLOSURE_OF_UNIONS : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, forall f c= Power A, finite f -> closure_of A top (Union f) = Union {closure_of A top s | s :e Power A, s :e f}.
Admitted.

