// HOL Light: Multivariate/metric.ml:1204 / CLOSURE_OF_EQ
// Source hash: md5:f0edec45de0732dc5f8d9cd72473a7ba
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem CLOSURE_OF_EQ : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, forall s c= A, closure_of A top s = s <-> closed_in A top s.
Admitted.

