// Source hash: md5:2395c80d8a49299fd03f00fd9867b24e
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem CLOSED_IN_CONTAINS_DERIVED_SET : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, forall s c= A, closed_in A top s <-> derived_set_of A top s c= s /\ s c= topspace A top.
Admitted.

