Theorem CLOSED_IN_INTER_CLOSURE_OF : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, forall s t c= A, closed_in A (subtopology A top s) t <-> s :/\: closure_of A top t = t.
Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/metric.ml:1253 / CLOSURE_OF_CLOSED_IN
