// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_prod_setprod, hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem PROPER_MAP_FST : forall A B:set, A <> Empty -> B <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, forall top' :e topology B, proper_map (A :*: B) A (prod_topology A B top top',top) (fun x:set => x 0) <-> topspace A top = Empty \/ compact_space B top'.
Admitted.

