// Source hash: md5:0e02ae29750637005ee8adacd7133b81
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_typedef_net)
Theorem EVENTUALLY_FALSE : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall net0 :e net A, eventually A {x :e A | False} net0 <-> trivial_limit A net0.
