// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_typedef_metric, hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem METRIZABLE_SPACE_MTOPOLOGY : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall m :e metric A, metrizable_space A (mtopology A m).
Admitted.

