Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/metric.ml:14737 / CONNECTED_COMPONENTS_OF_EQ_SING
// Source hash: md5:22c4e5dc19ccbc99013bbef887b6ea8a
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem CONNECTED_COMPONENTS_OF_EQ_SING : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, forall s c= A, connected_components_of A top = {s} <-> connected_space A top /\ (~ topspace A top = Empty /\ s = topspace A top).
Admitted.

