Theorem CONNECTED_COMPONENTS_OF_CONNECTED_SPACE : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, connected_space A top -> connected_components_of A top = if topspace A top = Empty then Empty else {topspace A top}.
Admitted.

