Theorem LOCALLY_COMPACT_HAUSDORFF_OR_REGULAR : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, locally_compact_space A top /\ (hausdorff_space A top \/ regular_space A top) <-> locally_compact_space A top /\ regular_space A top.
Admitted.

