// Source hash: md5:2127b814072f22d4eb5a3d1524fd8b13
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem LOCALLY_COMPACT_SPACE_COMPACT_CLOSED_COMPACT : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, hausdorff_space A top \/ regular_space A top -> (locally_compact_space A top <-> forall k c= A, compact_in A top k -> exists u l c= A, u :e top /\ (compact_in A top l /\ (closed_in A top l /\ (k c= u /\ u c= l)))).
Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/metric.ml:16959 / LOCALLY_COMPACT_REGULAR_SPACE_NEIGHBOURHOOD_BASE
