// Status: generalization_required (bridges: empty_case:A, hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem PATH_COMPONENT_OF_REFL : forall A:set, forall top :e topology A, forall x :e A, path_component_of A top x x <-> x :e topspace A top.
Admitted.

