// Status: generalization_required (bridges: empty_case:A, hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem PATH_COMPONENT_OF : forall A:set, forall top :e topology A, forall x y :e A, path_component_of A top x y <-> exists t c= A, path_connected_in A top t /\ (x :e t /\ y :e t).
Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/metric.ml:22559 / PATH_COMPONENT_OF_SET
// Source hash: md5:a8e968c6f900be46d5cae485617209e2
