// Status: generalization_required (bridges: empty_case:A, hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem PATH_COMPONENT_OF_MAXIMAL : forall A:set, forall top :e topology A, forall s c= A, forall x :e A, path_connected_in A top s /\ x :e s -> s c= {x0 :e A | path_component_of A top x x0}.
Admitted.

