Theorem HOMEOMORPHIC_HEREDITARILY_NORMAL_SPACE : forall A B:set, A <> Empty -> B <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, forall top' :e topology B, homeomorphic_space A B top top' -> (hereditarily A {x :e topology A | normal_space A x} top <-> hereditarily B {x :e topology B | normal_space B x} top').
Admitted.

