Theorem FRONTIER_OF_LOCALLY_CONNECTED_SUBSPACE_COMPONENT : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, forall s c c= A, locally_connected_space A top /\ (closed_in A top s /\ c :e connected_components_of A (subtopology A top s)) -> frontier_of A top c = c :/\: frontier_of A top s.
Admitted.

