Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/metric.ml:26936 / QUASI_EQ_CONNECTED_COMPONENTS_OF_POINTWISE
// Source hash: md5:738bf2355b800c297f19327b82a68a06
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_typedef_topology)
Theorem QUASI_EQ_CONNECTED_COMPONENTS_OF_POINTWISE : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, quasi_components_of A top = connected_components_of A top <-> forall x :e A, x :e topspace A top -> forall x0 :e A, quasi_component_of A top x x0 <-> connected_component_of A top x x0.
Admitted.

