Theorem K_KC_SPACE_SUBTOPOLOGY : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e topology A, forall s c= A, k_space A top /\ (kc_space A top /\ (s :e top \/ closed_in A top s)) -> k_space A (subtopology A top s) /\ kc_space A (subtopology A top s).
Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/metric.ml:27702 / K_SPACE_AS_QUOTIENT_EXPLICIT
