Theorem MDIST_CAPPED : forall A:set, forall d :e R, forall m :e metric A, forall x y :e A, 0 < d -> mdist A (capped_metric A d m) (x,y) <= d.
Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/metric.ml:37518 / MTOPOLOGY_CAPPED_METRIC
